@startuml DFD_Level2_P4
title **LEVEL 2 — Process 4: Monitor Geofence**

skinparam backgroundColor White
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 10
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam arrowColor #1F2937
skinparam arrowThickness 1.2
skinparam arrowFontSize 8

skinparam rectangle<<ent>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 11
}
skinparam rectangle<<proc>> {
  BackgroundColor #DBEAFE
  BorderColor #2563EB
  RoundCorner 12
  FontStyle bold
  FontSize 10
}
skinparam rectangle<<ds>> {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  RoundCorner 0
  FontSize 9
}

top to bottom direction

rectangle "Teacher" as TCH <<ent>>
rectangle "Student" as STU <<ent>>

rectangle "4.1\nReceive\nGPS Data"                                     as P41 <<proc>>
rectangle "4.2\nCompare Location\nwith Geofence\nBoundaries"           as P42 <<proc>>
rectangle "4.3\nGenerate\nGeofence Alert\n(if Outside Boundary)"       as P43 <<proc>>
rectangle "4.4\nNotify Teacher\n(Alarm + Dialog,\n1 Alert per Student)" as P44 <<proc>>
rectangle "4.5\nWarn Student\n(Alarm Until\nRe-entry)"                 as P45 <<proc>>

rectangle "D1  |  Trip Details"          as D1 <<ds>>
rectangle "D5  |  SOS & Geofence Alerts" as D5 <<ds>>
rectangle "D6  |  GPS Location Data"     as D6 <<ds>>

D6  --> P41 : GPS data stream\n(5s interval)
D1  --> P42 : geofence boundaries\n(per stop, all stops)
P41 --> P42 : current coordinates
P42 --> P43 : location status\n(outside geofence)
P43 --> D5  : alert record
P43 --> P44 : geofence alert\n(student name, distance)
P43 --> P45 : out-of-bounds flag
P44 --> TCH : alarm + notification dialog\n(deduped per student)
P45 --> STU : alarm (rings until re-entry)\nno dismiss button

@enduml
